%27s_Whelm_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Allandra%27s_Whelm_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Allandra%27s_Whelm_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/55/Allandra%27s_Whelm_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Trident_of_the_Waves\" title=\"Trident of the Waves\">Trident of the Waves</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Water\" title=\"Water\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e2/Water_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Water_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e2/Water_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Water_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e2/Water_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Water_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e2/Water_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Water_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e2/Water_A_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Water\" title=\"Water\">Water</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Water_Barrel\" title=\"Water Barrel\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Water_Barrel_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Water_Barrel_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Water_Barrel_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Water_Barrel_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Water_Barrel_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Water_Barrel_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Water_Barrel_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Water_Barrel_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Water_Barrel_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Water_Barrel\" title=\"Water Barrel\">Water Barrel</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<p>Spells and actions:\n</p>\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r347748\"><div class=\"div-col\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Create_Water\" title=\"Create Water\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Create_Water_Icon.webp/30px-Create_Water_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Create_Water_Icon.webp/45px-Create_Water_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Create_Water_Icon.webp/60px-Create_Water_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Create Water\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Create_Water_Icon.webp/30px-Create_Water_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d1/Create_Water_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Create_Water\" title=\"Create Water\">Create Water</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Slam_(Water_Elemental)\" title=\"Slam (Water Elemental)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Slam_Water_Elemental_Icon.webp/30px-Slam_Water_Elemental_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Slam_Water_Elemental_Icon.webp/45px-Slam_Water_Elemental_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Slam_Water_Elemental_Icon.webp/60px-Slam_Water_Elemental_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Slam (Water Elemental)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Slam_Water_Elemental_Icon.webp/30px-Slam_Water_Elemental_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/87/Slam_Water_Elemental_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Slam_(Water_Elemental)\" title=\"Slam (Water Elemental)\">Slam (Water Elemental)</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Minor_Conjuration:_Create_Water\" title=\"Minor Conjuration: Create Water\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Create_Water_Icon.webp/30px-Create_Water_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Create_Water_Icon.webp/45px-Create_Water_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Create_Water_Icon.webp/60px-Create_Water_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Minor Conjuration: Create Water\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Create_Water_Icon.webp/30px-Create_Water_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d1/Create_Water_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Minor_Conjuration:_Create_Water\" title=\"Minor Conjuration: Create Water\">Minor Conjuration: Create Water</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Interactions\">Interactions</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Turns into <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Electrified_Water\" title=\"Electrified Water\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Electrified_Water_surface_Icon.webp/25px-Electrified_Water_surface_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Electrified_Water_surface_Icon.webp/38px-Electrified_Water_surface_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Electrified_Water_surface_Icon.webp/50px-Electrified_Water_surface_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Electrified Water\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Electrified_Water_surface_Icon.webp/25px-Electrified_Water_surface_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/75/Electrified_Water_surface_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Electrified_Water\" title=\"Electrified Water\">Electrified Water</a> for <span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 2 turns after being exposed to lightning damage. Reverts back to water afterwards.</li>\n<li>Turns into <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ice_(surface)\" title=\"Ice (surface)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/89/Ice_surface_Icon.webp/25px-Ice_surface_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/89/Ice_surface_Icon.webp/38px-Ice_surface_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/89/Ice_surface_Icon.webp/50px-Ice_surface_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ice\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/89/Ice_surface_Icon.webp/25px-Ice_surface_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/89/Ice_surface_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ice_(surface)\" title=\"Ice (surface)\">Ice</a> for <span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 2 turns after being exposed to ice damage. Reverts back to water afterwards.</li>\n<li>Turns into a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Steam_Cloud\" title=\"Steam Cloud\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4a/Steam_Cloud_cloud_Icon.webp/25px-Steam_Cloud_cloud_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4a/Steam_Cloud_cloud_Icon.webp/38px-Steam_Cloud_cloud_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4a/Steam_Cloud_cloud_Icon.webp/50px-Steam_Cloud_cloud_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Steam Cloud\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4a/Steam_Cloud_cloud_Icon.webp/25px-Steam_Cloud_cloud_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4a/Steam_Cloud_cloud_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Steam_Cloud\" title=\"Steam Cloud\">Steam Cloud</a> for <span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 2 turns after being exposed to a fire surface.</li></ul>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>As of <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://baldursgate3.game/news/patch-6-now-live_108\">Patch #6</a>, can be created by interacting with a <a href=\"/wiki/Water_pump\" title=\"Water pump\">water pump</a>.</li>\n<li>Dipping a weapon into this surface removes <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dipped_in_Fire_(Condition)\" title=\"Dipped in Fire (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/Dipped_in_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Dipped_in_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/62/Dipped_in_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Dipped_in_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/62/Dipped_in_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Dipped_in_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dipped in Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/Dipped_in_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Dipped_in_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/62/Dipped_in_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dipped_in_Fire_(Condition)\" title=\"Dipped in Fire (Condition)\">Dipped in Fire</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dipped_in_Poison_(Condition)\" title=\"Dipped in Poison (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Coated_in_Basic_Poison_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Coated_in_Basic_Poison_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Coated_in_Basic_Poison_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Coated_in_Basic_Poison_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Coated_in_Basic_Poison_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Coated_in_Basic_Poison_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dipped in Poison\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Coated_in_Basic_Poison_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Coated_in_Basic_Poison_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Coated_in_Basic_Poison_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dipped_in_Poison_(Condition)\" title=\"Dipped in Poison (Condition)\">Dipped in Poison</a>, and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Burning_(Condition)\" title=\"Burning (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Burning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Burning_(Condition)\" title=\"Burning (Condition)\">Burning</a> on the weapon, if applicable.</li>\n<li>Standing on a Water Surface cleans off dirt and blood, as does using these items: <a href=\"/wiki/Soap_Bar\" title=\"Soap Bar\">Soap Bar</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Sponge\" title=\"Sponge\">Sponge</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Sponge_Tray\" title=\"Sponge Tray\">Sponge Tray</a>, and Mattis's <a href=\"/wiki/Holy_Hand_Soap\" title=\"Holy Hand Soap\">Holy Hand Soap</a></li>\n<li>Water of sufficient depth (i.e. Deep Water) is considered <a href=\"/wiki/Difficult_Terrain\" title=\"Difficult Terrain\">Difficult Terrain</a> in game.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200142\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.123 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.135 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 6000/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 60974/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 14840/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 982/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.055/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1144982/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  113.645      1 -total\n 99.21%  112.743      1 Template:Area_page\n 34.23%   38.900      8 Template:Item_icon\n 18.25%   20.739     72 Template:Trim\n 15.71%   17.854     10 Template:Icon_link\n 14.88%   16.907     10 Template:Icon_text\n 13.91%   15.811      3 Template:Cond\n 12.03%   13.676      3 Template:Area\n 11.01%   12.516     26 Template:Ifempty\n 10.90%   12.389     16 Template:ItemIcon_Internal\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:2029-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714200142 and revision id 265376. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}